     BSD-3-Clause, see LICENSE) for headless GeoFDI simulation:
     (1) visual mesh assets/geoms removed (collision primitives only; no rendering needed);
     (2) FL_calf upper collision cylinder symmetrized to the FR/RL/RR values (menagerie typo);
     (3) accelerometer/gyro/framequat/framelinvel sensors added at the existing 'imu' site;
